    "title": "3 Perfect Fall days then a strong, windy cold front. Hard freezes coming to Oklahoma. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By No media credit provided. ,\n5 hours ago\nSimply perfect Fall weather thru mid afternoon Saturday to enjoy our Fall color. Look for a windy strong cold front at 3:30PM Saturday in OKC. Wind Chills by Sunday morning will be in low 20s. Look for a hard freeze with heavy frost Monday morning. Mike November 5th, 2025 #okwx\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KFOR.com Oklahoma City.\n1",
